<title>USA: California REIT approves sale to Zell Group.</title>
<headline>California REIT approves sale to Zell Group.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>California Real Estate Investment Trust said Monday it has approved the sale of Peregrine Real Estate Trust's 76 percent ownership interest in the Trust to CalREIT Investors L.P..</p>
<p>CalREIT is an affiliate of Equity Group Investments Inc, an investment company headed by financier Sam Zell.</p>
<p>California Real Estate Investment Trust said in a statement it plans to implement a new business strategy which will be focused on mezzanine financing opportunities associated with income-producing real estate.</p>
</text>
